610,"type":{"id":1,"name":"Aired Order","type":"official"},"name":"辰南觉醒篇 (Chen nan jue xing pian)","number":1,"nameTranslations":["zho,eng,spa,por"],"overviewTranslations":["por"],"companies":[{"id":0,"primaryCompanyType":0}]},{"id":2010860,"seriesId":422610,"type":{"id":3,"name":"Absolute Order","type":"absolute"},"number":1,"nameTranslations":[],"overviewTranslations":[],"companies":[{"id":0,"primaryCompanyType":0}]},{"id":2139498,"seriesId":422610,"type":{"id":1,"name":"Aired Order","type":"official"},"name":"学城风云篇 (Xue cheng feng yun pian)","number":2,"nameTranslations":["zho,eng,spa,por"],"overviewTranslations":["por"],"companies":[{"id":0,"primaryCompanyType":0}]},{"id":2174473,"seriesId":422610,"type":{"id":1,"name":"Aired Order","type":"official"},"number":3,"nameTranslations":["eng,zhtw"],"overviewTranslations":[],"companies":[{"id":0,"primaryCompanyType":0}]}],"translations":{"nameTranslations":[{"name":"神墓 ","language":"zho","IsPrimary":true},{"name":"Tomb of Fallen Gods","language":"eng","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Shen Mu","isAlias":"true","language":"eng","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Divine Grave","isAlias":"true","language":"eng","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Tomb of the Gods","isAlias":"true","language":"eng","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Гробница богов","language":"rus","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Túmulo dos Deuses Caídos","language":"por","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Sepultura Divina","isAlias":"true","language":"por","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Túmulo dos Deuses","isAlias":"true","language":"por","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Tomb of Fallen Gods","language":"fra","IsPrimary":false}],"overviewTranslations":[{"overview":"该书以主角辰南寻找万年前爱人雨馨、追索神魔灭亡遗秘的行迹为线索，引出浩茫六道、天地棋局，演绎出一部充满热血、壮烈、凄美的传奇，道说出无数英雄佳人的传说，并对人性、社会、生命等元素进行了些许探讨","language":"zho","IsPrimary":true},{"overview":"Shenmo Cemetery, resting place of ancient Gods and Demons. An inconspicuous grave, surrounded by the tombs of giants, lies at the side. Suddenly, a young man emerges from the grave.\r\nChen Nan, who had last felt the embrace of death, finds himself surrounded by the graves of Deities whose names shook the old Xiuhuan and Mohuan Continents. What happened to them? Why was he buried here as well? He finds that ten thousand years has passed, and the world has changed much in the meantime.(novel update)","language":"eng","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"Главный герой, Чэнь Нань, ищет свою любимую, которую потерял десять тысяч лет назад, Юй Синь. Он начинает поиски из расследования смерти божества, что приводит его в мир полный интриг, сражений и красоты.","language":"rus","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"Cementerio Shen Mu, lugar de descanso de antiguos dioses y demonios. Una tumba discreta, rodeada por las tumbas de gigantes, yace a un lado. De repente, un joven emerge de la tumba, después de haber estado muerto durante diez mil años, Chen Nan  resucita en el misterioso cementerio de \"Shen Mu\". Sin saber por qué lo devolvieron a la vida, se embarca en un viaje para comenzar su vida de nuevo.","language":"spa","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"Cemitério de Shenmo, local de descanso dos antigos deuses e demónios. Uma sepultura discreta, rodeada por túmulos gigantes, fica mesmo ao lado. Um jovem emerge do túmulo. Chen Nan, que sentiu pela última vez o abraço da morte, encontra-se rodeado pelos túmulos de divindades cujos nomes abalaram os antigos continentes Xiuhuan e Mohuan. O que aconteceu? Porque é que ele foi enterrado aqui? Descobre que dez mil anos se passaram e que o mundo mudou muito entretanto.","language":"por","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"Cet animé raconte l’histoire de Chen Nan, un guerrier ancien qui sort d’un immense cimetière de dieux et de démons après environ dix mille ans de sommeil dans un monde transformé. Il découvre un nouveau continent où magie, arts martiaux et créatures surnaturelles coexistent. En quête de réponses sur sa résurrection, le déclin des dieux et la disparition de sa bien-aimée Yuxin, il traverse des terres dangereuses, affronte des adversaires puissants, explore des tombeaux anciens et se retrouve mêlé à des conflits entre familles, secrets mystiques et reliques anciennes. Pendant son voyage, Chen Nan grandit, forge des alliances et s’efforce de comprendre son passé tout en naviguant dans un monde rempli de mystères et de forces surnaturelles.","language":"fra","IsPrimary":false}],"aliases":"[Shen Mu,Divine Grave,Tomb of the Gods,Sepultura Divina,Túmulo dos Deuses]"},"contentRatings":[],"seasonTypes":[{"id":1,"name":"Aired Order","type":"official"},{"id":3,"name":"Absolute Order","type":"absolute"}]}